<p class="note">
  Distances in hexes.
  <% if bounds.width %>
    Measured on a map <%= bounds.width %> tiles wide<%= ", inferred from the plots rather than reported by the log" if bounds.estimated? %>.
  <% else %>
    The map width is unknown, so distances do not wrap around the map edge.
  <% end %>
  Spacing is the mean distance to the nearest own city: 7 leaves no tiles shared at full growth, around 4 means cities
  permanently overlap. Elongation near 1.4 is a compact empire, 2 and above one strung out in a line.
</p>
